[{"client_msg_id":"b96d9b5b-a0bd-4d52-a85e-6fc35aff5ceb","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ですね！","ts":"1634567704.374500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Val"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1789360e-5d5a-4b67-a32f-a1e6d6008790","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"毎回GB級のファイルをドンとgrepに渡していたら，大変ですからね！","ts":"1634567695.374300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tMq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1718765a-2eff-4278-971c-90ccb946fb94","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"おおお、面白い！ありがとうございます。","ts":"1634567683.374000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kkDm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1abe31af-6f8e-4d38-b6a0-8ae065389b74","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"たとえば，とても多きなCSVファイルがあると，これを `cat ultra_hyper_large_data.csv | grep foo` で検索すると，grepは効率のために，コマンドを終了するまえに読み込みを始めることができます．","ts":"1634567650.373300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q6PH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"691660c9-f24f-429d-8936-17c85b2c50be","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"fzfというよりシェルスクリプトのパイプの機能ですね．`|`で挟まれた二つのコマンドは同時に起動されてstdoutとstdinがつながれます．イメージ的にはloopで一行がstdouに出力されると，まんまfzfに一行がstdinとして入力されます．実際には，プログラムによってバッファリングされると思うので，あくまでもイメージですが．","ts":"1634567528.369800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+9bVJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a168330-0c82-4402-a987-51eb93a40fc2","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"`fzf` のリスト更新ってこんな簡単にできるんですね。。。\n `loop`の実行終了を待ってから `fzf`が起動するものとばかり思ってました。\nシェルスクリプトを雰囲気で使ってるのがバレるんですが、どんな原理なんでしょう？\n```function loop() {\n  for i in {1..5}; do\n    echo $i\n    sleep 0.5 \n  done\n}\n\nloop | fzf```","ts":"1634567049.366700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"57cyE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb7474d4-2640-4bc7-82c1-1ed2a1566995","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e 古い env が入ってると動かないので直しました。\n\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh/pull/39\u003e","ts":"1634554682.365100","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh/pull/39|#39 do not use `env -S`\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh/pull/39|#39 do not use `env -S`\u003e","text":"Because, older versions of `env` do not have the `-S` (--split-string) option.","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh|yuki-yano/zeno.zsh\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1634542309}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ygG3A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e169f565-075f-4995-bf86-99cbbb0e21e1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ふと気になってコメントと空行抜きのzshrcの行数を数えたら522行だった","ts":"1634553134.364100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ahtAn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d14e298b-4875-461e-86b7-5d9ed994e3b7","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ついでに `--zeno-mode`  がない時に `printf() in src/app.ts:51` に undefined が渡って内部エラーになります。","ts":"1634536702.363200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dMX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5356c5b-b974-4f30-a818-ba1cd2e8e232","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとで入れます・・・","ts":"1634536696.363100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LtR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd08cc81-1b61-47c4-9db9-ba3835e59da3","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"修正忘れてました","ts":"1634536693.362800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Az7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc8d2c8b-1a92-4cf8-a84b-f3a57350bf2e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あっ","ts":"1634536686.362600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8LLbL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8223f4ab-a99d-47f2-b756-c4e5e9807a85","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e \u003chttps://zenn.dev/yano/articles/zsh_plugin_from_deno\u003e この記事の example が間違ってませんか？\n`zeno --mode=...` になってますが、`zeno --zeno-mode=...` ではないでしょうか。","ts":"1634536596.361500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Zenn: Deno + TypeScriptでzshプラグインを実装して最高になった","id":1,"title":"Deno + TypeScriptでzshプラグインを実装して最高になった","title_link":"https://zenn.dev/yano/articles/zsh_plugin_from_deno","image_url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/zenn/image/upload/s--A0qeYG6T--/co_rgb:222%2Cg_south_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_37_bold:Yuki%2520Yano%2Cx_203%2Cy_98/c_fit%2Cco_rgb:222%2Cg_north_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_70_bold:Deno%2520%252B%2520TypeScript%25E3%2581%25A7zsh%25E3%2583%2597%25E3%2583%25A9%25E3%2582%25B0%25E3%2582%25A4%25E3%2583%25B3%25E3%2582%2592%25E5%25AE%259F%25E8%25A3%2585%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%25A6%25E6%259C%2580%25E9%25AB%2598%25E3%2581%25AB%25E3%2581%25AA%25E3%2581%25A3%25E3%2581%259F%2Cw_1010%2Cx_90%2Cy_100/g_south_west%2Ch_90%2Cl_fetch:aHR0cHM6Ly9saDMuZ29vZ2xldXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tL2EtL0FPaDE0R2liaDZMcy05WWRBbnZqZGtvMzJuTllGZEY3UThVWXE0N3kxNklhPXM4MC1j%2Cr_max%2Cw_90%2Cx_87%2Cy_72/v1627274783/default/og-base_z4sxah.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Zenn","service_icon":"https://zenn.dev/images/icon.png","from_url":"https://zenn.dev/yano/articles/zsh_plugin_from_deno","original_url":"https://zenn.dev/yano/articles/zsh_plugin_from_deno"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J+nI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45e2f34f-18c5-4661-86ab-ebde1feb45b1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"zinitから移行しよう","ts":"1634515768.359500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+g8zw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08f040c1-5f32-45c7-a3b1-bf7115d28c70","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"え、efmっていつの間にかhomebrew対応してたの・・・","ts":"1634515764.359300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sLrI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e37c9cff-bc05-4687-ada6-6514fc9c9101","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ありすえさんのmanpagerプラグイン、Manの改善だったのか、忘れてた\n\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/vim-manpager\u003e","ts":"1634515589.358800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"lambdalisue/vim-manpager","id":1,"title":"lambdalisue/vim-manpager","text":"Use Vim as a MANPAGER program","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"39","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MZoW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1052daeb-8236-4d08-9012-52fd41f0beb3","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"でけた。ls ( `exa --color=always` ) の結果をfzf で複数選択して、絞り込んだ結果をターミナルに残したかったのでした。どれだけ便利か分かりませんが、活躍の場はある……気がしてます。\n```function lf() {\n  local LIST=\"$( ls \"$@\" )\"\n  local SEL_TXT=\"$( echo \"$LIST\" | command cat -n | fzf-tmux --ansi --multi --with-nth 2.. )\"\n  local SEL_NUM=\"$(echo \"$SEL_TXT\" | awk '{print $1}' | tr '\\n' 'p' | sed -e 's/p/p;/g')\"\n  echo \"$LIST\" | sed -n $SEL_NUM\n}```","ts":"1634483666.358100","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1634483831.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=335Q"}]}]
